MODULE: DeferralClockOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: first deferral stores an invalid elapsed-clock state
PERTURBS: Defer

--- FIND
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![Head(queue)] = IF @ = Timeout + 1 THEN 0 ELSE @]
--- REPLACE
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![Head(queue)] = Timeout + 2]
--- END
